tle":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1567"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-07T11:48:06-07:00","id":965138,"title":"","content":"Why we can't? There is published material that makes rules for it, and even more there is lore that justifies it.<br /> Published material tell us you can create new rituals and path? Gives you even rules for it and gives you a lore background for make it work? They you can use it.<br /> And it's not even a secondary book,since it's the main book that explains how the conversion from mage to vampire works.<br /> <br /> Besides as I said there is plenty of lore about it, the New Thaumaturgic paths the Anarchs created that you can find in Rites of Blood, the history of Mary St.Johns in New York by nights, it's lore, and, even more, it'supported by a rule system in a canon book.<br /> <br /> And it has always been so with Thaumaturgy, there is a reason there are few rituals for high level of Hermetic Thauma,Abyss Mysticism,Koldun and so on,because basically at the higher level Blood magic starts working much like the true magic, this is way Velya has devised from zero a ritual to unbind the Tzimisce, that's why the Council of Nine was able to curse the assamites, that's why Baba could rise the Gauntlet, this is why Kemintiri has a unique ritual for her, this is way Menele was able to unleash the fury of the Vesuvius on Pompei, because from level six Blood Magic can be used to do not just what you &quot;can&quot; do, but what you &quot;need&quot; to do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12142-undead-rabbit","name":"Undead rabbit","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date"